WEBVTT

00:44.720 --> 00:47.810
Excuse me. What are you doing here?

00:52.220 --> 00:53.590
Who are you?

00:53.760 --> 00:56.960
Wow! There are a lot of crabs.

00:58.860 --> 00:59.900
You want one?

01:01.520 --> 01:03.020
But I am not going to give it to you!

01:03.020 --> 01:05.470
I found all these.

01:05.920 --> 01:11.650
Look, this one is called a green thin clawed hermit crab. They're not normal hermit crabs, you see...

01:11.820 --> 01:16.040
Its most distinguishable characteristic is its claw.

01:12.420 --> 01:15.870
Come on, hurry back to the ocean while you still can.

01:16.050 --> 01:18.730
The claw is full of little holes. It's so beautiful.

01:18.200 --> 01:21.580
Bye bye. Take care.

01:23.070 --> 01:24.980
What are you doing?

01:25.720 --> 01:31.410
Eh? Let them go back to the ocean. Poor crabs...

01:31.920 --> 01:34.400
Crabs?

01:36.160 --> 01:40.640
They're not crabs, they're hermit crabs. <i>HERMIT CRABS!</i>

01:41.920 --> 01:44.120
Whatever their name is!

01:44.120 --> 01:48.210
Of course not. Hermit crabs are not crabs.

01:49.020 --> 01:50.060
Do you understand?

01:50.120 --> 01:52.660
Come on, go back to the ocean now.

01:53.240 --> 01:54.620
Not again.

01:56.960 --> 01:58.770
Hey, wait!

02:02.220 --> 02:03.640
I see.

02:04.040 --> 02:08.090
I will give you one. Stay away from here.

02:10.420 --> 02:13.870
It hurts... Ah, a hermit crab is on my head!

02:15.020 --> 02:16.260
Isn't this fun?

02:25.020 --> 02:28.010
Mom...

02:47.810 --> 02:49.090
I'm home.

02:53.420 --> 02:56.490
Onii-chan, we finished moving in already.

02:56.720 --> 02:57.890
Where's my room?

02:58.020 --> 02:59.930
It's the one with the balcony.

03:00.120 --> 03:02.090
And our neighbor is...

03:02.520 --> 03:03.920
Are you listening to me?

03:22.710 --> 03:25.990
Ah, you're the guy who was catching the hermit crabs just now.

03:30.020 --> 03:31.950
Hey, I can see your panties.

03:35.920 --> 03:40.440
The Hermit Crab and the Straw Hat

03:58.170 --> 03:59.840
I want to sleep a little bit more...

04:03.100 --> 04:04.710
Is this true?

04:05.120 --> 04:05.890
Yes!

04:06.520 --> 04:08.510
Well, Dono, please give me the order!

04:09.610 --> 04:10.760
Behead them.

04:12.720 --> 04:14.100
Who should be beheaded?

04:14.440 --> 04:16.390
Just kill the guy over there.

04:17.520 --> 04:18.230
Yes!

04:41.420 --> 04:42.780
Good morning, Onii-chan.

04:47.120 --> 04:48.980
Why didn't you wake me up!?

04:49.120 --> 04:50.530
I called for you several times earlier.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.440
Was it because you studied too late for the test last night?

04:53.610 --> 04:55.620
Hmm, yeah.

04:55.660 --> 04:59.660
Huh? Isn't it your turn today, Onii-chan?

05:00.520 --> 05:02.680
My... turn?

05:04.950 --> 05:05.890
It's my turn again.

05:09.410 --> 05:10.430
Let's go ahead.

05:10.620 --> 05:12.590
Don't be late for the test.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.150
Nanami?!

05:59.120 --> 06:02.030
What? Geez.

06:02.420 --> 06:04.150
Hey! Get up, Nanami.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.370
Shaking... shaking...

06:08.410 --> 06:12.150
What's shaking? I can see your panties.

06:12.190 --> 06:13.250
Get up.

06:14.210 --> 06:19.070
Ah? Ken-chan, good morning.

06:20.320 --> 06:22.720
What's this 'good morning' you're talking about?

06:22.720 --> 06:26.490
Ah, pajamas! This is bad.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.910
Hey, watch out!

06:28.920 --> 06:31.720
Eh? What's so dangerous?

06:34.820 --> 06:36.580
It's so cramped here.

06:36.620 --> 06:38.800
Hey, we're going to be late.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.350
Ah, that's right.

06:42.020 --> 06:45.600
We have a final exam today. Hurry up.

06:47.420 --> 06:49.930
I was planning on getting up earlier so I could go over my notes again.

06:50.410 --> 06:54.610
Well, at least summer vacation begins after the last exam. We only have to last a few more days.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.040
Shut up!

06:59.120 --> 07:01.050
What on earth are you doing?

07:01.060 --> 07:04.800
Ah... Well, umm...

07:05.120 --> 07:08.050
Sorry, can you help me out?

07:08.550 --> 07:09.900
You owe me then.

07:34.620 --> 07:35.830
Nanami

07:36.760 --> 07:39.480
What's all the noise about?

07:41.660 --> 07:42.620
Nevermind...

07:42.980 --> 07:45.990
Mom, why do you look like that...

07:46.470 --> 07:50.200
I haven't been seen by anyone outside the family...

07:50.370 --> 07:51.660
but...

07:58.630 --> 08:00.110
Ken-chan!

08:51.810 --> 08:53.850
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Ken-chan.

09:22.760 --> 09:24.500
Now we should be able to catch up.

09:28.410 --> 09:30.690
Ah, wait up!

09:35.500 --> 09:37.620
Wow. Summer feels so great.

09:40.470 --> 09:42.040
Ah, this is not good.

09:46.970 --> 09:49.040
What are you doing this time?

09:49.080 --> 09:52.040
Well... my ribbon is tangled up.

09:56.440 --> 09:59.770
If this keeps up, once the high tide comes in, I'll drown.

10:06.870 --> 10:11.440
No! Stop it, stop it, the bell's going to ring.

10:15.840 --> 10:18.070
That was really mean, Ken-chan.

10:18.070 --> 10:19.780
Not really.

10:22.670 --> 10:25.250
All right, I'll help you out. Come here.

10:25.370 --> 10:26.470
You promise you're not going to do it again?

10:26.470 --> 10:28.050
Hmm, maybe.

10:28.670 --> 10:30.980
What do you mean by 'maybe'?

10:33.970 --> 10:35.870
Hey, Nanami-sensei...

10:36.370 --> 10:37.730
What?

10:38.420 --> 10:40.870
You are going to abandon your hostage?

10:40.970 --> 10:42.120
Hostage?

10:52.910 --> 10:55.660
Ah, good morning, you two.

10:55.670 --> 10:58.170
Good morning, Tae-senpai.

10:58.170 --> 11:00.590
Senpai, what are you doing here this early?

11:00.620 --> 11:02.480
Cleaning this area.

11:02.570 --> 11:03.820
Cleaning?

11:03.970 --> 11:06.010
It seems pretty dirty here.

11:06.070 --> 11:08.210
But today is the final exam.

11:08.370 --> 11:11.010
Yeah, I know.

11:11.390 --> 11:13.800
But I have to clean this up if I see that it's dirty.

11:13.970 --> 11:16.560
Well, senpai, we've got to run to class now.

11:17.470 --> 11:19.080
Excuse me.

11:21.170 --> 11:22.430
Nanami, hurry up.

11:23.470 --> 11:25.320
Don't run in the hallway.

11:37.970 --> 11:38.970
Let's go.

12:17.510 --> 12:19.730
Yo, how was your test?

12:20.340 --> 12:22.960
Same old, same old. How about you, Hatano?

12:23.670 --> 12:25.980
Hmm, just hoping they don't make me attend summer school.

12:26.270 --> 12:27.900
Geez.

12:30.370 --> 12:33.060
After the final exam, it will be summer vacation.

12:33.270 --> 12:35.400
Yeah, summer vacation.

12:38.770 --> 12:41.760
Ken-chan, let's go home now.

12:41.770 --> 12:42.770
Yeah.

12:43.370 --> 12:44.650
See you then, Kenji.

12:47.070 --> 12:48.910
Please say 'hi' to your wife for me.

12:50.170 --> 12:51.370
Shut up!

12:56.920 --> 12:58.680
I am so hungry.

12:59.550 --> 13:01.470
What do you want to have for lunch?

13:02.110 --> 13:04.000
By the way, what's today's special?

13:05.600 --> 13:07.580
I think it's meat noodles.

13:07.710 --> 13:08.880
Not bad.

13:09.170 --> 13:12.580
Well let's make a contribution to your business.

13:22.370 --> 13:23.160
Welcome...

13:24.270 --> 13:25.170
Welcome back.

13:25.170 --> 13:26.270
Good afternoon!

13:26.370 --> 13:27.680
I'm back.

13:29.440 --> 13:30.930
It's still hot out there today?

13:31.570 --> 13:34.170
Yeah, very hot.

13:34.170 --> 13:36.620
I'll make some drinks for you.

13:37.410 --> 13:39.350
Ah, I'll do it.

13:40.260 --> 13:40.840
Okay.

13:47.870 --> 13:49.340
Thanks for the treat!

13:51.170 --> 13:52.470
How was it?

13:52.470 --> 13:55.590
Very delicious, especially the vegetables.

13:57.470 --> 13:59.860
That's what we harvested last time.

14:00.310 --> 14:03.000
Oh, last time...

14:20.570 --> 14:21.630
Eggplant.

14:21.870 --> 14:24.750
In that case, our water-eggplant should taste good too.

14:28.570 --> 14:30.340
Thank you.

14:33.970 --> 14:35.400
Here you go, Mom.

14:35.570 --> 14:40.040
Nanami, can you go to the field and get some water eggplant and young soybeans for me please?

14:40.970 --> 14:43.440
I need some pumpkins and corn too.

14:43.610 --> 14:46.560
Ah? Pumpkins are very heavy.

14:46.570 --> 14:48.320
I'll go with you.

14:48.550 --> 14:49.450
Really?

14:52.070 --> 14:54.640
You always help us out, Tomosaka-kun.

14:54.870 --> 14:59.020
Ah, yeah. You can take a wagon with you.

14:59.910 --> 15:02.080
Huh? We have one at home?

15:02.670 --> 15:06.110
Our neighbor from the field next to ours said we're welcome to use his.

15:10.070 --> 15:11.670
Haha, this should be really easy then.

15:11.670 --> 15:12.400
Yeah.

15:13.170 --> 15:14.170
Excuse me!

15:14.670 --> 15:18.460
Sorry, we don't need to use the... wagon.

15:19.770 --> 15:21.530
A wagon would make it much easier.

15:21.970 --> 15:24.800
I'll carry it, we don't need to use the wagon.

15:25.610 --> 15:28.520
Hmm, But it would be easier...

15:28.770 --> 15:30.430
Anyway, let's hurry up and get going.

15:31.470 --> 15:33.100
Ken-chan, wait for me!

15:34.770 --> 15:35.530
Nanami.

15:36.010 --> 15:37.680
Huh? What?

15:37.970 --> 15:39.160
You forgot this.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.490
Oh, my...

15:57.010 --> 16:00.570
Ahhh! It's still really hot out today.

16:27.470 --> 16:28.750
How about this part?

16:29.710 --> 16:32.930
Hmm, maybe we should leave it and let it grow longer.

16:34.970 --> 16:36.240
How about these?

16:38.470 --> 16:39.950
Those are good.

16:40.270 --> 16:41.370
How about here?

16:41.380 --> 16:43.270
Yeah, okay.

16:43.670 --> 16:45.700
Well, please take care of them, Ken-chan.

17:11.670 --> 17:16.030
Nanami, haven't those watermelons ripened already?

17:16.170 --> 17:19.370
Yeah, they're ripe. But they are way too heavy to carry home...

17:20.410 --> 17:21.690
That's true.

17:24.670 --> 17:26.280
Do you want to use the wagon?

17:28.870 --> 17:30.740
It should be very easy.

17:33.740 --> 17:35.930
Fresh water feels so good.

17:58.210 --> 18:00.110
 (Tl Note: The watermelon says: Nanami , don't eat!!)

18:18.170 --> 18:20.620
All right, I'm finished watering the field.

18:27.590 --> 18:29.280
Ken-chan, I finished watering the field.

18:29.770 --> 18:31.490
Why are you eating now?

18:34.470 --> 18:37.340
I have no idea what you are talking about.

18:41.070 --> 18:42.280
Come here and have some.

18:42.290 --> 18:44.400
Okay, thanks.

18:44.410 --> 18:47.400
Ahhhhh, this watermelon is...

18:49.570 --> 18:50.660
What's wrong?

18:51.170 --> 18:54.790
That's a watermelon I put a lot of effort in raising, a 'Nanami Special'.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.860
'Nanami special'?

18:58.070 --> 19:00.910
Why'd you eat it?

19:02.070 --> 19:06.750
Well, how can you say this watermelon is a 'Nanami Special'? Show me the evidence.

19:08.890 --> 19:12.030
Maybe this is only a normal watermelon.

19:15.070 --> 19:17.360
Where is the evidence, Nanami-kun?

19:19.970 --> 19:21.720
The evidence is here.

19:27.470 --> 19:30.270
Look here.

19:30.600 --> 19:31.780
 (Tl Note: The watermelon says: Nanami Special, don't eat!!)

19:35.170 --> 19:38.010
Are you still a child?

19:39.070 --> 19:42.730
Geez, why did you eat this?

19:48.670 --> 19:52.720
Delicious! That's why it's called a 'Nanami Special'.

19:52.730 --> 19:54.890
Yeah, it tastes good.

19:57.500 --> 19:59.260
Now you owe me one.

19:59.370 --> 20:02.720
Yeah, I know. This time I owe you one.

20:03.310 --> 20:05.380
Yeah, you owe me.

20:09.410 --> 20:11.650
Huh? What's wrong?

20:12.070 --> 20:13.470
No, nothing.

20:20.110 --> 20:22.640
Hey! That's mine...

20:22.780 --> 20:24.240
That's because you eat too slow.

20:24.970 --> 20:26.230
Come on, Ken-chan.

20:30.770 --> 20:32.420
Ah, not again!

20:33.570 --> 20:35.080
Stop it!

20:45.970 --> 20:48.180
Thanks for today, Ken-chan.

20:48.550 --> 20:49.730
No problem, see you tomorrow then.

20:58.570 --> 21:00.020
What's wrong?

21:00.270 --> 21:04.070
Nanami, tomorrow it's your turn to wake me up.

21:04.370 --> 21:06.100
Yeah.

21:06.600 --> 21:10.820
I won't get up that easily. Understand?

21:12.170 --> 21:16.110
Geez. Don't discourage me!

21:16.170 --> 21:18.830
Well, see you tomorrow for real this time.

21:18.970 --> 21:20.950
Okay! Good night!

21:45.570 --> 21:47.370
Good morning, Suzuka-chan!

21:47.370 --> 21:49.530
Good morning, Nanami onee-chan!

21:49.570 --> 21:51.070
Is Ken-chan with you?

21:51.070 --> 21:54.510
No way. How could Onii-chan get up by himself?

21:55.170 --> 21:57.610
Yeah, I was just asking.

21:58.860 --> 22:02.010
Ah, it's this late already? I'll be late if I don't hurry!

22:03.170 --> 22:06.890
Next episode: The Summer Field and the Nanami Special

22:04.860 --> 22:10.020
